  "description": "Another Zombie Apocalypse modpack, filled with guns and action!",
  "body": "![Banner For Guns and Zombies](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/69be90cc4d54cc400b041bec7330d8ebcd8e7334.png)\n\n# GET READY TO BATTLE ZOMBIES\n\nGuns and Zombies features lots of zombies and **LOTS** of guns to fight them with! It also features villagers that will fight alongside you (just make sure not to shoot them).\n\nThe terrain has also been altered but still follows the vanilla minecraft style of terrian so there aren't any new biomes to worry about, just explore, make guns and fight zombies with them!! \n\nFor an extra challenge try this on Hardcore!!\n![Shoot!](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0ca789bed4bbbc7767db296bb78ce9e8273c660_0.webp)",
